WEBVTT

00:00:02.140 --> 00:00:03.430
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:06.520
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime</i>

00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:00:12.690 --> 00:00:16.280
<i>GUNDAM</i>

00:00:12.690 --> 00:00:16.280
<i>MOBILE SUIT</i>

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:16.280
<i>Minna ga neshizumatta yoru
In the night when everyone else was lost in their sleep...</i>

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:18.620
<i>Mado kara sora wo miru to
I looked at the sky through the window...</i>

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:23.540
<i>Tottemo sugoi mono wo mita n' da
...and there I saw such a great thing!</i>

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:28.840
<i>Otona wa dare mo warai-nagara
All the adults told me with a great big laugh...</i>

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:31.340
<i>Terebi no misugi to iu kedo
"You've been watching way too much television again!"</i>

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:34.920
<i>Boku wa zettai ni zettai ni
But I would never, ever...</i>

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:37.140
<i>Uso nanka itte 'nai
...tell any kind of lie!</i>

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:45.520
<i>Joushiki to iu megane de
This world of ours...</i>

00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:51.020
<i>Boku-tachi no sekai wa
...cannot be viewed through...</i>

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:54.820
<i>Nozokeya shinai no sa
...the glasses of common sense.</i>

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:58.320
<i>Yume wo wasureta
You old earthlings...</i>

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:02.830
<i>furui chikyuu-jin yo
...who have forgotten your dreams!</i>

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:07.830
<i>Anime Ja Nai! Anime Ja Nai!
It's not Anime! It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:10.330
<i>Fushigi na kimochi
Such a wonderful feeling!</i>

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:12.420
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:15.840
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:20.140
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:01:22.010 --> 00:01:25.020
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:01:33.910 --> 00:01:37.170
A girl named Roux Louka came
from the La Vie en Rose...

00:01:37.170 --> 00:01:40.750
and now I want the Argama to
get out of Shangri-La as fast as it can.

00:01:40.920 --> 00:01:43.920
No one's going to stand for any more
holes being shot in the colony!

00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:48.930
Someone said he'd get the hatch open for
free, but that was too much to hope for.

00:01:48.930 --> 00:01:51.220
A boy can't live if he's so credulous!

00:01:53.100 --> 00:01:57.230
THE FUNERAL BELL TOLLS TWICE

00:02:13.950 --> 00:02:18.000
Rest in peace,
heroes of Gaza Storm.

00:02:18.170 --> 00:02:20.670
Eat all the fruit
you want now!

00:02:23.090 --> 00:02:26.010
Pampa! How could
you have been killed?!

00:02:26.840 --> 00:02:31.430
All right, toll the funeral bell
so that their souls will be at peace.

00:02:38.600 --> 00:02:41.860
Why are they having a funeral
instead of assembling the new suit?!

00:02:41.860 --> 00:02:44.030
- Well, they died in the Earth Sphere...
- What?!

00:02:44.030 --> 00:02:48.030
Haven't you heard this is how the dead
are honored in the Earth Sphere, sir?!

00:02:48.240 --> 00:02:51.870
The memorial satellite Lady Haman is
making isn't good enough for them?!

00:02:52.530 --> 00:02:54.750
That plan?

00:02:57.910 --> 00:03:01.630
We want something warmer that
we can relate to more personally, sir.

00:03:03.500 --> 00:03:07.420
As we speak, the Argama could be
leaving through that hatch on their end.

00:03:08.510 --> 00:03:10.050
Pampa!

00:03:11.140 --> 00:03:14.310
Have you forgotten
Lady Haman's words?!

00:03:14.310 --> 00:03:16.810
They say the best gift
for the dead is vengeance!

00:03:19.350 --> 00:03:20.730
I'm going!

00:03:20.730 --> 00:03:22.610
Master Mashymre, wait!

00:03:22.610 --> 00:03:25.940
Stop the funeral!
Prep the Endra for launch, at once!

00:03:26.070 --> 00:03:27.400
But the service...

00:03:27.400 --> 00:03:29.400
Orders from Master Mashymre!

00:03:29.400 --> 00:03:33.530
The best memorial we can give the
dead is the capture of the Argama!

00:03:33.530 --> 00:03:34.740
Is that clear?!

00:03:34.740 --> 00:03:36.040
Yes, sir!

00:04:04.110 --> 00:04:06.110
Judau, you getting off
when the signal comes?

00:04:06.110 --> 00:04:07.320
Dunno.

00:04:07.320 --> 00:04:09.030
It's Elle's hovercraft!

00:04:13.820 --> 00:04:14.620
A signal!

00:04:14.620 --> 00:04:15.700
But it's red!

00:04:15.700 --> 00:04:16.910
Guys!

00:04:16.910 --> 00:04:20.120
What are you standing there for?
They just signaled that the hatch is open!

00:04:20.120 --> 00:04:21.830
That would be a blue flare!

00:04:21.830 --> 00:04:23.710
So what does red mean?

00:04:23.710 --> 00:04:25.710
It's a signal to gather
the junk dealers together.

00:04:25.710 --> 00:04:26.840
Trouble! Trouble!

00:04:26.840 --> 00:04:29.420
The junk dealers are putting
Mr. Chimatter on trial!

00:04:29.420 --> 00:04:30.420
The junk dealers?!

00:04:30.420 --> 00:04:32.130
In the plaza in
front of the hatch!

00:04:33.220 --> 00:04:34.340
What are you planning to do?!

00:04:34.340 --> 00:04:37.100
We have to save Mr. Chimatter!

00:04:37.100 --> 00:04:39.890
Jeez, you colonists are useless!

00:04:40.140 --> 00:04:41.310
What was that?!

00:04:45.770 --> 00:04:48.150
Is the Junk Dealers Union
really that violent?

00:04:49.150 --> 00:04:50.900
They're unusually so.

00:04:50.900 --> 00:04:53.860
Usually, the union
just uses its power...

00:04:53.860 --> 00:04:58.160
to control access to the hatch
to shake people down for money.

00:04:58.580 --> 00:05:00.160
Then how did Roux Louka get in?

00:05:00.160 --> 00:05:01.710
Getting in is easy.

00:05:01.710 --> 00:05:04.540
Because that Core Fighter is
smaller than a mobile suit.

00:05:04.540 --> 00:05:07.420
Captain Bright!
Judau's taking the Zeta out!

00:05:07.420 --> 00:05:08.920
Without my permission?!

00:05:08.920 --> 00:05:11.420
He got mad when we said
you weren't on the bridge.

00:05:11.420 --> 00:05:12.260
Stop him!

00:05:14.890 --> 00:05:18.050
I can't let an outsider deal
with Shangri-La's business!

00:05:18.430 --> 00:05:21.220
We'll see what Roux Louka can do.
It's too soon to go, Judau!

00:05:22.180 --> 00:05:27.730
Now is the time when we in the Junk
Dealers Union must stand as one!

00:05:27.730 --> 00:05:32.110
There's a guy here who told us
to open the hatch for an outside ship!

00:05:32.400 --> 00:05:36.280
Has an outside ship ever once
done anything good for us?!

00:05:36.280 --> 00:05:37.620
No!

00:05:37.820 --> 00:05:40.200
They even wrecked
my own mobile suit!

00:05:44.410 --> 00:05:47.670
What do you mean?
What's wrong with your mobile suit?

00:05:50.460 --> 00:05:53.220
I had to stay up all night
fixing this thing!

00:05:53.380 --> 00:05:55.720
This has been happening
since that outside ship came!

00:05:55.840 --> 00:05:58.470
We can't just let
them get away with this!

00:06:07.230 --> 00:06:10.230
Roux!
She moves so quickly!

00:06:10.520 --> 00:06:14.820
And besides that! This guy lost his
family and fortune because of them!

00:06:14.820 --> 00:06:16.700
Don't you feel
sorry for him?!

00:06:16.700 --> 00:06:18.820
They can't get away with that!

00:06:24.830 --> 00:06:25.710
Want some?

00:06:25.710 --> 00:06:28.250
N-No, thanks.
I'm a vegetarian.

00:06:30.670 --> 00:06:32.000
What are you...?!

00:06:32.000 --> 00:06:34.920
What are you doing?!
I didn't do anything!

00:06:37.840 --> 00:06:40.220
What's the big idea?!
Judau?

00:06:40.550 --> 00:06:42.100
You said we were useless, so--

00:06:43.640 --> 00:06:47.020
No! That's dangerous!
It'll blow up! Boom!

00:06:49.520 --> 00:06:51.520
This is no bomb.

00:06:51.770 --> 00:06:53.480
Yes, it is! A big one!

00:06:53.480 --> 00:06:55.820
Don't play around with it!
I mean it!

00:06:59.240 --> 00:07:01.320
Shut up! Keep quiet!

00:07:02.530 --> 00:07:05.660
If they send up that flare,
the Argama will take off.

00:07:05.660 --> 00:07:07.460
Hey! It's the enemy!

00:07:14.340 --> 00:07:16.300
The hatch still isn't open.

00:07:17.420 --> 00:07:19.430
Magnify the area
around that junk heap.

00:07:19.430 --> 00:07:20.300
Sir!

00:07:22.930 --> 00:07:26.730
The Zeta! It has to be!
If we blast that junk heap...

00:07:26.730 --> 00:07:27.680
Master Mashymre...!

00:07:28.310 --> 00:07:31.310
I don't wish to
damage this colony!

00:07:31.310 --> 00:07:33.400
However, it's near the center.

00:07:33.400 --> 00:07:36.400
The colony should be fine
if we fire just one shot.

00:07:36.480 --> 00:07:40.320
For the sake of the men
we've lost, we must do this!

00:07:42.910 --> 00:07:45.740
Death accompanies battle.

00:07:45.740 --> 00:07:50.330
Every soldier gives up their individual
life to die for the Principality of Zeon.

00:07:51.170 --> 00:07:55.590
You must give honorable funerals
to the dead soldiers, Mashymre.

00:07:56.500 --> 00:07:57.710
My lady!

00:07:57.710 --> 00:08:01.840
But what do you think will
comfort their spirits the most?

00:08:02.510 --> 00:08:03.510
Well...

00:08:03.510 --> 00:08:05.010
You don't know?

00:08:05.010 --> 00:08:07.220
N-No...

00:08:07.350 --> 00:08:12.350
It would be taking vengeance
for them, Mashymre.

00:08:13.730 --> 00:08:18.230
Mashymre, it's not enough
to simply make a grave for them.

00:08:18.230 --> 00:08:21.320
As a soldier yourself,
you must see that.

00:08:21.320 --> 00:08:24.820
We live our lives according
to Lady Haman's will!

00:08:24.950 --> 00:08:26.370
Do it! I said do it!

00:08:26.370 --> 00:08:28.370
R-Roger! Firing, sir!

00:08:35.920 --> 00:08:38.380
Don't run! Fight!
I said fight!

00:08:42.800 --> 00:08:44.220
Judau! Where's the Zeta?

00:08:44.220 --> 00:08:46.140
Not anywhere I can get to quickly.

00:08:46.140 --> 00:08:49.930
I'll take the Core Fighter out.
Judau, you go save Mr. Chimatter.

00:08:49.930 --> 00:08:51.640
Can you handle that?

00:08:51.640 --> 00:08:53.600
Don't underestimate me!

00:08:58.020 --> 00:08:58.820
Judau!

00:08:58.820 --> 00:09:01.400
Damn you, Endra...
Are you attacking us now?

00:09:01.400 --> 00:09:03.410
What are you doing?!
The enemy's here!

00:09:03.410 --> 00:09:05.490
But that isn't the Argama!

00:09:05.490 --> 00:09:08.830
You said you'd do any work
as long as I fed you!

00:09:08.910 --> 00:09:12.660
A man must hold on to
what he once aspired to do!

00:09:12.750 --> 00:09:15.420
What? You?!
You're working with the Argama?

00:09:15.420 --> 00:09:16.710
You're still alive?!

00:09:16.710 --> 00:09:17.790
Why, you...!

00:09:20.510 --> 00:09:22.220
Where's the Argama?!

00:09:22.420 --> 00:09:23.720
Um, look up there.

00:09:29.010 --> 00:09:30.020
You okay?

00:09:31.220 --> 00:09:33.520
- Into the mobile suits, fast!
- Right!

00:09:35.400 --> 00:09:37.110
Come on! Get in!

00:09:37.110 --> 00:09:40.900
- I'm going back to the Zeta!
- Damn! I left the flare!

00:09:40.900 --> 00:09:42.320
Never mind that!

00:09:42.320 --> 00:09:44.700
If it's set off,
the Argama will launch!

00:09:44.700 --> 00:09:46.780
Okay, wait here!

00:09:49.830 --> 00:09:50.660
Let's do it!

00:09:50.660 --> 00:09:52.450
We'll stomp them!

00:09:56.040 --> 00:09:58.460
There it is!
This must be it.

00:09:59.040 --> 00:10:00.460
I found him!

00:10:04.340 --> 00:10:06.130
You won't stomp
me that easily!

00:10:06.130 --> 00:10:07.090
Pass!

00:10:09.890 --> 00:10:11.310
Judau!

00:10:11.310 --> 00:10:12.390
All right!

00:10:12.390 --> 00:10:13.600
Why, you...!

00:10:15.600 --> 00:10:17.400
Huh? A new weapon?!

00:10:20.110 --> 00:10:21.400
Things got worse.

00:10:21.400 --> 00:10:23.690
What happens if the
Argama launches now?!

00:10:23.690 --> 00:10:25.490
We have to tell them!

00:10:25.610 --> 00:10:28.530
The blue flare!
That's the sign the hatch is open!

00:10:28.620 --> 00:10:31.530
Right! Prepare to lift off!
All hands to your stations!

00:10:31.530 --> 00:10:32.410
Okay!

00:10:34.830 --> 00:10:36.120
What do we do?!

00:10:36.120 --> 00:10:39.580
I'll take responsibility! We just
have to open the hatch, right?!

00:10:40.840 --> 00:10:43.920
They're headed into the car hatch!
Stop them, Yazan!

00:10:43.920 --> 00:10:44.800
How?

00:10:44.800 --> 00:10:46.420
Figure it out yourself!

00:10:53.010 --> 00:10:56.430
You lousy pitcher...!
I'll go in there myself!

00:10:59.230 --> 00:11:00.150
Can I do it?

00:11:07.610 --> 00:11:09.240
Forget the rats!

00:11:09.240 --> 00:11:11.950
Where'd that little punk get to?!

00:11:11.950 --> 00:11:14.450
Aw, man! It must have
gotten buried earlier.

00:11:14.540 --> 00:11:16.910
That ship sure does horrible things.

00:11:16.910 --> 00:11:19.330
I hope the cockpit's
still in one piece.

00:11:20.040 --> 00:11:21.040
Wha?

00:11:24.800 --> 00:11:27.970
- You'll pay for what you did, punk!
- Hey! Behind you!

00:11:44.020 --> 00:11:46.820
The Argama's taken off!
The sector to the right!

00:11:46.820 --> 00:11:50.570
Not good! Not good!
They're leaving too soon!

00:11:56.660 --> 00:11:58.580
Argama...

00:11:58.620 --> 00:12:01.290
So, this is where you've been hiding.

00:12:17.520 --> 00:12:19.850
- You think he's okay?
- Who?

00:12:19.850 --> 00:12:22.810
What if my brother
doesn't come back?

00:12:22.810 --> 00:12:26.900
It's okay. Judau's not the type
who'd abandon his little sister.

00:12:27.030 --> 00:12:29.610
I'm more worried about Fa.

00:12:29.610 --> 00:12:33.110
She wants to stay in Shangri-La,
but she's forcing herself to leave.

00:12:33.110 --> 00:12:34.030
You knew?

00:12:34.030 --> 00:12:35.830
We'll leave you an energy pack.

00:12:35.830 --> 00:12:37.910
Thanks! How are
Beecha and the others?

00:12:37.910 --> 00:12:39.120
We brought theirs.

00:12:39.120 --> 00:12:42.330
Okay, let's cut loose!
We'll wipe out the enemy!

00:12:42.330 --> 00:12:44.710
Right. If we do that, then Kamille...

00:12:44.710 --> 00:12:46.540
And here come our guests!

00:12:54.340 --> 00:12:56.890
That's it! Keep driving the Argama!

00:12:56.890 --> 00:12:59.100
But if the hatch is open...

00:12:59.100 --> 00:13:01.390
If it is, just fire the main guns!

00:13:01.390 --> 00:13:05.100
We can use them nicely
without harming any locals.

00:13:05.100 --> 00:13:07.520
This is taking too long!

00:13:10.400 --> 00:13:11.690
Does it work?

00:13:20.660 --> 00:13:22.660
Get me there in time!

00:13:27.630 --> 00:13:30.210
- Speaking of "lousy pitcher"...
- Shut up!

00:13:41.430 --> 00:13:43.430
Do they want to rip
the Argama apart?!

00:13:43.430 --> 00:13:46.480
It'd still be worth a fortune,
even if they did!

00:13:48.820 --> 00:13:52.030
The Zeta?! Why would it return
if the hatch is open?!

00:13:52.030 --> 00:13:54.240
- Hold down the fort!
- Elle!

00:13:54.240 --> 00:13:57.620
Come about, 180 degrees!
Make for the hatch!

00:13:57.620 --> 00:14:00.830
Captain! It's Judau.
He needs to speak with you!

00:14:00.830 --> 00:14:01.620
What's wrong?

00:14:01.620 --> 00:14:03.410
That flare was launched accidentally!

00:14:03.410 --> 00:14:04.290
What?!

00:14:04.290 --> 00:14:06.420
The flare was fired by accident!

00:14:10.000 --> 00:14:11.920
I won't let you
get in my way!

00:14:11.920 --> 00:14:14.470
If the Argama gets away,
I get no money!

00:14:19.640 --> 00:14:21.010
- Belay the turn!
- Aye, aye!

00:14:21.010 --> 00:14:23.640
Judau, keep the enemy
occupied and climb!

00:14:29.150 --> 00:14:32.440
- Gun turrets! What are you doing?!
- Judau's flying in front of us!

00:14:32.440 --> 00:14:33.150
Judau!

00:14:33.150 --> 00:14:34.440
Sorry! My fault!

00:14:34.440 --> 00:14:36.030
I'll drive him off at once!

00:14:38.700 --> 00:14:40.740
The Argama's
stopped its turn, sir!

00:14:41.030 --> 00:14:41.780
What?!

00:14:41.780 --> 00:14:45.250
Those junk dealers' suits seem to be
blocking the Argama's path.

00:14:54.510 --> 00:14:55.840
Now! Fire!

00:14:55.840 --> 00:14:57.010
Fire?!

00:14:57.010 --> 00:14:59.140
We've dialed down
the beam energy!

00:15:00.510 --> 00:15:03.770
If this blasts a hole in
the colony, it's not my fault!

00:15:08.810 --> 00:15:10.190
Gemon! Don't die!

00:15:10.190 --> 00:15:11.520
Zeta...!

00:15:17.700 --> 00:15:18.910
You did it, Judau!

00:15:18.910 --> 00:15:20.110
Elle, how long have you...?!

00:15:20.110 --> 00:15:22.200
Torres, ready the main guns!

00:15:22.830 --> 00:15:24.990
If we're blocked,
we'll be forced to use them.

00:15:24.990 --> 00:15:26.830
We'll fend off
the Endra, and then...

00:15:26.830 --> 00:15:28.210
What was...?!

00:15:29.120 --> 00:15:30.420
What was that shock?

00:15:33.090 --> 00:15:35.420
All you do is get in my way!

00:15:39.510 --> 00:15:42.220
You left me starving and bitter!

00:15:42.220 --> 00:15:44.310
If you're gonna shoot me,
then start shooting!

00:15:46.890 --> 00:15:47.810
Let it go!

00:15:47.810 --> 00:15:49.730
Zeta! You again?!

00:15:49.730 --> 00:15:51.770
Another one who's
always getting in my way!

00:15:55.690 --> 00:15:58.610
What?
It's more agile than it looks!

00:15:59.570 --> 00:16:03.240
I was once a Titan, and now
I'm forced to live in misery!

00:16:03.570 --> 00:16:08.200
Forced to bow and scrape and
pretend to be a damn junk dealer!

00:16:08.200 --> 00:16:10.830
It's all your fault!

00:16:11.040 --> 00:16:16.500
I'm stuck on this colony only because
you beat me in that battle before!

00:16:16.500 --> 00:16:17.710
That wasn't me!

00:16:17.710 --> 00:16:21.590
Playing innocent?! Do you know how
many times I nearly died because of you?!

00:16:21.590 --> 00:16:23.640
I said it wasn't me!

00:16:25.930 --> 00:16:27.720
It wasn't me!

00:16:27.720 --> 00:16:30.060
Emergency message from Roux Louka!

00:16:30.440 --> 00:16:31.730
I heard from Judau.

00:16:31.730 --> 00:16:33.600
I've opened the hatch!

00:16:33.600 --> 00:16:36.110
I opened the hatch!
I'll give you details later!

00:16:36.110 --> 00:16:38.110
It's open now,
so get moving!

00:16:38.110 --> 00:16:39.610
Hurry!

00:16:39.610 --> 00:16:40.780
Keep 'em covered!

00:16:41.400 --> 00:16:44.320
Roux Louka...
The girl's got guts.

00:16:44.320 --> 00:16:45.200
Begin turn!

00:16:49.500 --> 00:16:50.790
Don't give me that crap!

00:16:50.790 --> 00:16:53.210
What crap?
What are you planning?

00:16:54.290 --> 00:16:56.000
Turn complete!

00:16:56.000 --> 00:16:59.130
Okay, engines ahead!
I mean reverse!

00:17:06.140 --> 00:17:08.310
The Argama's begun
moving towards the hatch!

00:17:08.310 --> 00:17:09.640
Not yet!

00:17:10.140 --> 00:17:12.770
If we attacked it here,
we'd destroy the colony.

00:17:13.310 --> 00:17:17.570
We'll destroy it where the main
body of the colony won't be damaged.

00:17:21.440 --> 00:17:24.410
He's gonna ram us both
into the Argama!

00:17:24.410 --> 00:17:27.120
Argama, run for it!
I'm running for it, too!

00:17:27.200 --> 00:17:30.330
Roux got the hatch open!
Where do we run?!

00:17:30.500 --> 00:17:31.830
Roux did?!

00:17:33.500 --> 00:17:34.330
You won't escape!

00:17:36.750 --> 00:17:38.790
You stupid jerk...!
That's what you think!

00:17:41.010 --> 00:17:41.670
What?

00:17:43.630 --> 00:17:45.510
My secret body-changing technique!

00:17:49.220 --> 00:17:51.720
There we go! Almost there!

00:17:53.140 --> 00:17:54.270
Right! Fire!

00:17:54.270 --> 00:17:56.400
Mobile suit silhouettes ahead!

00:17:56.400 --> 00:17:57.730
Destroy them along with it!

00:17:59.690 --> 00:18:01.650
Firing beam cannons!

00:18:05.030 --> 00:18:05.700
What's...?!

00:18:14.040 --> 00:18:15.620
Th-The main gun!

00:18:15.620 --> 00:18:17.420
Endra, still closing!

00:18:17.420 --> 00:18:20.920
They intend to deal with
us inside the hatch.

00:18:21.380 --> 00:18:24.220
Target the Endra with
our mega-particle cannon!

00:18:24.220 --> 00:18:25.550
Aye, aye!

00:18:25.550 --> 00:18:28.430
Check range! Make sure only
the Endra is destroyed!

00:18:29.100 --> 00:18:31.390
Adjusting mega particle
cannon energy!

00:18:33.390 --> 00:18:36.600
Zeta, what are you doing?!
Clear the way!

00:18:40.610 --> 00:18:43.480
I need this thing
to be a mobile suit!

00:18:45.400 --> 00:18:46.570
The Zeta!

00:18:46.820 --> 00:18:48.530
I'm going out in
the Hamma-Hamma!

00:18:48.530 --> 00:18:49.410
But...!

00:18:49.410 --> 00:18:51.910
It's the least I owe to our dead!

00:18:53.740 --> 00:18:55.540
Is the Hamma-Hamma
ready to launch?!

00:18:55.540 --> 00:18:56.500
It should be.

00:18:57.250 --> 00:18:57.920
Fire!

00:19:07.050 --> 00:19:09.010
Catapult deck is damaged!

00:19:09.010 --> 00:19:09.800
What?

00:19:09.800 --> 00:19:12.510
They haven't finished assembling
the Hamma-Hamma, sir!

00:19:12.510 --> 00:19:13.510
What?

00:19:13.510 --> 00:19:17.180
Endra! Withdraw from the
Argama's firing range immediately!

00:19:21.610 --> 00:19:23.440
The controls!

00:19:30.740 --> 00:19:32.780
At this rate...

00:19:32.780 --> 00:19:35.620
I'll never be able to make this
up to our dead comrades.

00:19:36.620 --> 00:19:38.710
Lady Haman herself told me...

00:19:38.750 --> 00:19:42.710
that I must be sure to honor
our comrades who have fallen in battle.

00:19:42.710 --> 00:19:44.420
And besides...

00:19:44.460 --> 00:19:47.050
We owe that to the colonists
who have died, as well.

00:19:48.010 --> 00:19:48.970
Sir!

00:19:49.930 --> 00:19:50.890
I am...

00:19:52.640 --> 00:19:54.680
...a Newtype!

00:19:56.020 --> 00:19:57.680
Now stop and transform!

00:20:00.020 --> 00:20:00.940
Huh?

00:20:02.310 --> 00:20:04.650
Huh? Uh-oh!

00:20:15.990 --> 00:20:17.080
Judau!

00:20:17.240 --> 00:20:18.620
Big Brother!

00:20:18.620 --> 00:20:19.500
Leina!

00:20:19.500 --> 00:20:20.830
You had me worried!

00:20:20.830 --> 00:20:21.830
Sorry.

00:20:21.830 --> 00:20:24.000
Nice job, Judau.

00:20:24.000 --> 00:20:26.210
Aw, it was nothing.

00:20:26.210 --> 00:20:29.090
I knew you could do it, Judau.

00:20:29.920 --> 00:20:31.220
Where's Roux Louka?

00:20:32.640 --> 00:20:35.260
Leading the Argama
to the La Vie en Rose.

00:20:35.300 --> 00:20:38.350
What? You mean we're just
headed right into space?

00:20:38.350 --> 00:20:40.940
We can't let Shangri-La
end up being destroyed.

00:20:40.940 --> 00:20:43.100
But I have a job
and school, right?

00:20:43.100 --> 00:20:46.360
Then you'd better do some
studying here on the Argama, Judau!

00:20:47.110 --> 00:20:48.820
Don't you think?

00:20:48.900 --> 00:20:51.110
Captain!
We're leaving the colony!

00:20:52.700 --> 00:20:54.620
Where's that girl,
Roux Louka?

00:20:54.620 --> 00:20:56.030
There.

00:21:11.380 --> 00:21:13.130
Good luck, Argama!

00:21:16.010 --> 00:21:18.220
Do you understand, Mashymre?

00:21:18.220 --> 00:21:20.430
Of all the things
I've taught you,

00:21:20.430 --> 00:21:24.310
the most important is that you
adapt yourself to the Earth Sphere.

00:21:24.310 --> 00:21:27.110
Once you understand
the locals and their customs,

00:21:27.110 --> 00:21:30.900
you will begin to be able to
make the Earth Sphere your own.

00:21:32.320 --> 00:21:35.910
Lady Haman... How am I to
understand these things?

00:21:36.370 --> 00:21:42.330
Master Mashymre, we found this bone in
the mobile suit that rammed the Endra.

00:21:42.330 --> 00:21:43.330
Just that?

00:21:43.370 --> 00:21:44.250
Yes, sir.

00:21:47.840 --> 00:21:50.710
A pig bone? Throw it in!

00:21:50.710 --> 00:21:53.470
The colony's dead citizens deserve
to be honored, as well.

00:21:58.930 --> 00:22:02.430
Master Mashymre! Next time,
we'll avenge our dead comrades!

00:22:05.390 --> 00:22:07.810
- Master Mashymre!
- Master Mashymre!

00:22:07.810 --> 00:22:09.230
You guys...

00:22:10.480 --> 00:22:13.740
Can a funeral really
improve morale so much?

00:22:15.110 --> 00:22:18.450
Is this what Lady Haman
was speaking of?

00:22:20.740 --> 00:22:22.910
I swear you'll
have your vengeance!

00:22:22.910 --> 00:22:26.420
And we will make the
Earth Sphere our own!

00:22:28.920 --> 00:22:31.800
Gottn! The Hamma-Hamma's
assembly is complete, correct?

00:22:31.800 --> 00:22:33.010
Yes, sir!

00:22:33.420 --> 00:22:35.720
Then just you wait, Argama!

00:22:46.100 --> 00:22:51.770
<i>michi mo nai areta genya ni
Amidst the wasteland without any roads...</i>

00:22:53.280 --> 00:22:58.990
<i>reeru wo tsukuru no wa kurushii koto sa
...it's difficult to lay down your rails.</i>

00:23:01.200 --> 00:23:03.490
<i>dakedo
However...</i>

00:23:03.490 --> 00:23:09.790
<i>tooi mukou mo shiranakucha ikenai
You've gotta know what's on the other side...</i>

00:23:09.790 --> 00:23:16.880
<i>boku-tachi wa kore kara nanda
...it's all from here on for us.</i>

00:23:16.880 --> 00:23:21.300
<i>"yume wo wasureta kodomo-tachi" to
"Children will forget their dreams"...</i>

00:23:21.300 --> 00:23:23.680
<i>hito wa iu
...is what they say.</i>

00:23:26.600 --> 00:23:33.900
<i>aa jidai ga naiteiru
Ah, the times are crying.</i>

00:23:46.060 --> 00:23:48.770
I thought we'd be safer
in the vastness of space.

00:23:48.770 --> 00:23:52.400
But Mashymre has sworn
on his rose to keep after us!

00:23:52.530 --> 00:23:56.280
That giant mobile suit Hamma-Hamma
is scary. And it looks powerful!

00:23:56.280 --> 00:24:00.200
On top of that, I forgot to bring
an energy pack for my beam rifle.

00:24:00.200 --> 00:24:04.410
So I have to come up with a desperate
strategy, with no success guaranteed!

00:24:04.410 --> 00:24:08.370
Next time, on Gundam ZZ:
"Judau in Space."

00:24:08.670 --> 00:24:12.750
You'll see the battlefield of Newtypes!

00:24:09.670 --> 00:24:12.850
JUDAU IN SPACE

00:24:09.670 --> 00:24:12.850
Next Time
